#: ../folio-assistant-core/processes/content/review-log-watch.bpmn:88
#. Diagram element documentation
msgid "For each changed row, the agent pass of Contributor feedback on a working draft: a new or edited row gets a proposal, Ready for agent = Yes gets its edit, Ready for merge = Yes its merge, and a Blue answer to a Decision needed question is taken up. The agent records its step on the Agent tab at once, with the real time."
msgstr ""

#: ../folio-assistant-core/processes/content/review-log-watch.bpmn:82
#. Diagram element documentation
msgid "For each row in the tool's append list (one per issue that no row's Issue cell links yet; owner, Q-WATCH2 B), appends it below the last row of Contributor Feedback: Title is the issue's title, the first Contributor Feedback column @login (#N): the issue's first paragraph, Issue its URL. The script gives each new row its Change-set id. No other writer adds issue rows. Then each row linking a closed issue (the tool's closedRows, and the rows just appended as closed) is hidden and its text struck through (owner, 2026-11-01 10:18Z)."
msgstr ""

#: ../folio-assistant-core/processes/content/review-log-watch.bpmn:94
#. Diagram element documentation
msgid "For every row the pass or the stall check wrote, Record agent step: the Agent tab row first (status, pull request, preview, step), then Feedback (agent) from it, then read back Agentic status and Staging review. A row whose Feedback (agent) names a pull request or preview its Agent row does not, or whose Agent step is not \"<step> <time>\", is fixed here (owner, 2026-11-01)."
msgstr ""

#: ../folio-assistant-core/processes/content/review-log-watch.bpmn:69
#. Diagram label
msgid "Hand new feedback to the row's agent; take over stalled rows"
msgstr ""

