msgid "No agent work: the next wake is queued and the poll ends."
msgstr ""

#: ../folio-assistant-core/processes/content/review-log-watch.bpmn:108
#. Diagram label
msgid "Nothing changed"
msgstr ""

#: ../folio-assistant-core/processes/content/review-log-watch.bpmn:70
#. Diagram element documentation
msgid "On every poll, changed or not, new Blue feedback goes verbatim to the agent working the row, and a stalled row is restarted or taken over, on the owner's rule of 2026-11-01 21:08Z. For each row: new Blue feedback goes, verbatim and in the same poll, to the thread that owns the row (named in its Agent row or Feedback (agent)), and Feedback (agent) says who has it. A row is stalled when its Blue cells changed, or Ready for agent turned Yes, more than 10 minutes ago and no Agent step was recorded since; or when its agent recorded no step for 2 hours. A stalled row's owning thread is asked once; with no answer within 10 minutes, or a thread that is done or stopped, the watcher takes the row over, or asks the coordinator for a new thread, and writes the new owner, the step and a link into Feedback (agent). The owner's words: \"when new feedback check if current agent is still working and provide it to them. if not try and pick up\"; \"agent should also watch for stalled and restart as needed\"."
msgstr ""

#: ../folio-assistant-core/processes/content/review-log-watch.bpmn:28
#. Diagram element documentation
msgid "One poll of one drafting review log (a Contributor Feedback sheet) and its folio repository. A tool decides, with no agent judgement, whether anything a person set in the sheet or any open issue changed since the last poll. Only then does the agent append rows for new issues and do its pass. Skill: review-log-watch."
msgstr ""

#: ../folio-assistant-core/processes/content/review-log-watch.bpmn:57
#. Diagram label
msgid "Read the Contributor Feedback tab"
msgstr ""

#: ../folio-assistant-core/processes/content/review-log-watch.bpmn:58
#. Diagram element documentation
msgid "Reads Watch!F1:I1, the hash of the person-set cells that the sheet script writes on every refresh (Q-WATCH4 A), and Contributor Feedback's header row and Issue column, and saves them as JSON for the check. A sheet without the Watch hash yet is read whole. Reading is not agent work: it changes nothing."
msgstr ""

