msgstr ""

#: ../folio-assistant-core/processes/content/review-log-watch.bpmn:76
#. Diagram element documentation
msgid "The tool's status. unchanged (exit 0): the poll ends and no other agent work starts. changed (exit 10): its changes and the rows to append go on."
msgstr ""

#: ../folio-assistant-core/processes/content/review-log-watch.bpmn:53
#. Diagram element documentation
msgid "The watcher's poll: a chain of 1-minute delayed wakes, each queuing the next before it reads anything, with an hourly scheduled task that restarts the chain if it breaks (owner, 2026-11-01 19:47Z: every 1 minute, never skipping a poll during long work; it was 3 minutes from 10:20Z)."
msgstr ""

